\">ِن ن</span>ِّس<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِكُمْ إِنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>رْتَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>تُمْ فَعِدَّتُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ ثَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ثَةُ أَشْهُ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٍ و</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ــٰٓ</span>ــِٔى لَمْ يَحِضْنَ‌ۚ وَأُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَحْمَالِ أَجَلُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َضَعْنَ حَمْلَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ‌ۚ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َتَّقِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>عَل لَّهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِنْ أَمْرِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> يُسْرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ أَمْرُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>َلَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> إِلَيْكُمْ‌ۚ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َتَّقِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يُكَفِّرْ عَنْهُ سَيِّـَٔـاتِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَيُعْظِمْ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"أَسْكِنُوهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ مِنْ حَيْثُ سَكَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن و</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>دِكُمْ وَلَا تُض<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">َا</span>ٓرُّوهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ لِتُضَيِّقُو<span cla