ajweed":"وَكَأَيّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َرْيَةٍ عَتَتْ عَنْ أَمْرِ رَبِّهَا وَرُسُلِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> فَحَاسَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>نَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا حِسَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">بًا ش</span>َدِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دًا و</span>َعَذَّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>نَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا عَذَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بًا ن</span>ُّكْرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"فَذَاقَتْ وَبَالَ أَمْرِهَا وَكَانَ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>قِبَةُ أَمْرِهَا خُسْرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"أَعَدَّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ لَهُمْ عَذَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">بًا ش</span>َدِي<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">دًا‌ۖ ف</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَلْبَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۚ</span> قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>َلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ إِلَيْكُمْ ذِكْرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"رَّسُول<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اً ي</span>َتْلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَلَيْكُمْ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ مُبَيِّنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">تٍ ل</span>ِّيُخْرِجَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظُّلُمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ُورِ‌ۚ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>ُؤْم<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ِنۢ ب</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَيَعْمَلْ صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">حًا ي</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>خِلْهُ جَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">تٍ ت</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِى مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َحْتِهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَنْهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رُ خَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِدِينَ فِيه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَبَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">دًا‌ۖ ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> أَحْسَنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> رِزْقًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١١</span>"},{"id":12,"tajweed":"ٱللَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى خَلَقَ سَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>عَ سَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">تٍ و</span>َمِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ مِثْلَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ يَتَنَزَّلُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَمْرُ بَيْنَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ لِتَعْلَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><spa